&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BS degree in a technical or engineering discipline or relevant years of experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;12+ years of experience in network engineering, software, and distributed systems, including 6+ years managing high performance teams at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical experience in scaling a multi-vendor networking environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong technical craft mastery and engineering discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
