&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead 0→1 product development from discovery through launch and scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
