&lt;li&gt;Act as an objective resource and champion for the Engineering team and broader employee population.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex employee relations with discretion, providing executive coaching and facilitating constructive feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage deep HR expertise to lead initiatives in org design, compensation, performance management, D&amp;amp;I, and employee development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data-informed decision-making using people analytics and organizational health metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute strong judgment and discretion to ensure positive, professional outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the company culture by embodying and promoting &quot;The SoFi Way.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate robust, collaborative relationships with key stakeholders across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with People Team Centers of Excellence (CoEs) to execute strategic initiatives and support business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
